==Battleground==
*5 [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 6.67~20 seconds<sup>200f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Snache]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Madam the Savannah (Enemy)|Madam the Savannah]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Master A.]] spawns.
**Infinite [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
**3 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**2 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
**3 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**2 [[Pigge]]s spawn, delay 3.33~5 seconds<sup>100f~150f</sup>.
**3 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[Pigge]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**5 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**5 [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 1.67~3.33 seconds<sup>50f~100f</sup>.
**3 [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The boss itself is not very threatening on its own, however the supporting units can give you trouble. Survive until the early Dark spam ends and the rest of the stage won't pose too much trouble. Bring [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] to nuke the Dark enemies, while [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Sexy Legs Cat]] snipes Master A.

